      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2018978167,
      "text": "Tokenized stocks trade by RFQ, which needs an EIP-712 signature\nfrom the token holder. A contract has no private key, so the vendor\nmust accept ERC-1271. If it does not, a pooled vault cannot trade.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Tokenized stocks trade by RFQ, which needs an EIP-712 signature\nfrom the token holder. A contract has no private key, so the vendor\nmust accept ERC-1271. If it does not, a pooled vault cannot trade.",
